Z||000002||batboy||06-09-2000||07:28 AM||||Maybe this story would have went over better if there was a Fiero in it.<P><B>NOTE:</B> Please, never break cave formations off or vandalize cave walls like A.S. Swipe (did you catch the name pun)...that was the point of the story, Zilla will get you if you do!!! It's sad to see graffiti, smashed formations, and trash in caves...remember this is a wilderness of sorts...leave it as nature intended so future generations can enjoy the cave's pristine and unique beauty.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 06-09-2000).]||||reg||1
